# Decoy vocabulary for numen sleep mode (see modules/home/app-numen.nix).
# While asleep, numen only knows the words it has phrases for, so without
# these every utterance gets forced into the wake phrase. Each word here
# (plus every word from phrases/*.phrases) becomes a do-nothing phrase.
# Words unknown to the Vosk model are ignored, so adding more is harmless.
